WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.005 --> 00:00:05.875
Ask Meridian answers questions about your data from this run's facts only.

2
00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:11.499
Open it from the top bar on any screen.

3
00:00:11.499 --> 00:00:16.451
Start from a suggested question or type your own.

4
00:00:16.451 --> 00:00:23.564
Every number in the answer must match a fact. If one does not, the answer is withheld.

5
00:00:23.564 --> 00:00:29.922
The badge says the answer is grounded: every number in it matched a fact from this run.

6
00:00:29.922 --> 00:00:46.198
Figures in the answer are drawn to scale, so the size of each number is plain at a glance.

7
00:00:46.198 --> 00:00:52.580
The facts used and the rules cited sit under the answer, so you can check each figure.

8
00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:59.589
Rules cited link to the checks behind the answer. Open one to see its definition and its failing records.
